    "id": "post-substack-15",
    "title": "Los refrescos \"Zero\" y la ansiedad por el dulce 🥤🧠",
    "category": "Mitos y Ciencia",
    "summary": "Te pasa que intentas cuidarte cambiando los refrescos normales por sus versiones Zero o Light, pero sigues teniendo unos antojos brutales de dulce a media tarde?",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:768,&quot;width&quot;:1408,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2279356,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://galanutricion.substack.com/i/207423939?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!96zk!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f423c99-f807-486a-b4d3-3abbae94ba8a_1408x768.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>&#191;Te pasa que intentas cuidarte cambiando los refrescos normales por sus versiones &#8220;Zero&#8221; o &#8220;Light&#8221;, pero sigues teniendo unos antojos brutales de dulce a media tarde? &#128555;&#127851;</p><p>Es una trampa muy com&#250;n. Aunque estos refrescos no tengan calor&#237;as, sus edulcorantes artificiales son much&#237;simo m&#225;s potentes que el az&#250;car com&#250;n. Al tomarlos, enga&#241;as a tu cerebro: tus papilas gustativas detectan un sabor dulce extremo y tu cuerpo se prepara para recibir energ&#237;a. Al ver que esa energ&#237;a nunca llega, tu cerebro activa las alarmas y te genera una ansiedad incontrolable para que busques az&#250;car real, saboteando tus h&#225;bitos y alterando tu microbiota. &#128300;&#128260;</p><p>La soluci&#243;n no es volver al az&#250;car, sino reeducar tu paladar. Empieza a sustituir esos refrescos por agua con gas, hielo y rodajas de lim&#243;n, lima o menta fresca. Te dar&#225;n esa sensaci&#243;n refrescante y chispeante que buscas, pero sin alterar tus se&#241;ales de saciedad ni disparar tu ansiedad. &#127819;&#128166;</p><p>#NutricionConCiencia #AlimentacionConsiguiente #AnsiedadPorElDulce #CambioDeHabitos #Nutricionista #MicrobiotaSaludable #ComidaReal #SaludMetabolica</p>",
